{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":42.40999984741211,"text":"At the far end of the dinosaur gallery, in half-darkness, a life-size Tyrannosaurus rex turns its head, blinks, sniffs the air, and roars. It is not a fossil. It is a machine dressed in skin, built from real skeletons, and its motors make every movement. The real Tyrannosaurus lived 66 million years ago, was 12 meters long, and had teeth like bananas. A few small children cry, most want to see it again. Before you reach it, the route takes you over the fossils on a raised walkway, past the skull of a Triceratops with its three horns.","words":[{"word":"At","start":0,"end":0.46000000834465027},{"word":"the","start":0.46000000834465027,"end":0.699999988079071},{"word":"far","start":0.699999988079071,"end":1.1399999856948853},{"word":"end","start":1.1399999856948853,"end":1.3799999952316284},{"word":"of","start":1.3799999952316284,"end":1.559999942779541},{"word":"the","start":1.559999942779541,"end":1.7999999523162842},{"word":"dinosaur","start":1.7999999523162842,"end":2.200000047683716},{"word":"gallery","start":2.200000047683716,"end":2.559999942779541},{"word":"in","start":3.1600000858306885,"end":3.259999990463257},{"word":"half","start":3.259999990463257,"end":3.5999999046325684},{"word":"darkness","start":3.5999999046325684,"end":4.079999923706055},{"word":"a","start":4.579999923706055,"end":4.78000020980835},{"word":"life","start":4.78000020980835,"end":5.179999828338623},{"word":"size","start":5.179999828338623,"end":5.559999942779541},{"word":"Tyrannosaurus","start":5.559999942779541,"end":6.400000095367432},{"word":"rex","start":6.400000095367432,"end":6.880000114440918},{"word":"turns","start":6.880000114440918,"end":7.420000076293945},{"word":"its","start":7.420000076293945,"end":7.699999809265137},{"word":"head","start":7.699999809265137,"end":7.960000038146973},{"word":"blinks","start":8.859999656677246,"end":8.859999656677246},{"word":"sniffs","start":9.779999732971191,"end"